      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "looks like this was an issue with Poiyomi not vrchat they have since fixed it in poiyomi pro 11.0.47\n\n\"Contact touches are sized in meters at your avatar's uploaded size, so a scaled-up avatar touching you no longer fills the whole mask.\"",
